<title>USA: Studio Plus president departs.</title>
<headline>Studio Plus president departs.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Studio Plus Hotels Inc said on Tuesday Michael Moriarty, president and chief operating officer, left the company.</p>
<p>Norwood Cowgill Jr., chairman of the board and chief executive officer, has assumed Moriarty's responsibilities with the company, Studio Plus said.</p>
<p>A reason behind Moriarty's departure was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
